INSERT INTO product_translations (id, product_id, locale, name, slug, summary, description, usage_areas, meta_title, meta_description, translation_status) VALUES ('f3bb8ffe-07eb-5a09-a929-df226888ecc0', 'd45f51ab-7fe2-5bcd-8b2e-1a5fb251b67c', 'en', $h$Drum Mixer$h$, $h$drum-mixer-2$h$, $h$Mixer Motors and Equipment – Industrial Mixing Solutions$h$, $h$<div> <p>Industrial mixer motors and equipment are critical machines used for <strong>homogeneously mixing, dissolving or stabilizing</strong> liquids, gels, paints, chemicals and other fluids. They are indispensable for improving product quality and optimizing process times, especially in paint, chemical, food and manufacturing facilities.</p><p>HD Marine mixer motors and accessories offer reliable solutions for industrial mixing processes with <strong>high performance</strong>, <strong>durability</strong> and <strong>ease of use</strong>.</p> </div><div> <p>✔ <strong>High torque and stable performance:</strong> Powerful operation even in demanding mixing applications<br/>✔ <strong>Various mounting options:</strong> Suitable for tanks, drums, vessels and kettles<br/>✔ <strong>Durable motor construction:</strong> Long service life under continuous operation and heavy use<br/>✔ <strong>Adjustable speed control:</strong> Mixing speed adjustment according to need<br/>✔ <strong>Various mixer accessories:</strong> Propeller, helical, spiral and special impellers</p><p>Mixer equipment is available with different <strong>motor power, speed and shaft diameter</strong> options depending on the type of process.</p> </div>$h$, $h$<div> <p>HD Marine mixer motors and equipment are used especially in:</p><ul><li>Paint production and mixing facilities</li><li>Chemical industry and process lines</li><li>Food and beverage production</li><li>Cosmetics production lines</li><li>Production of pigmented and solids-laden liquids</li><li>Laboratory mixing applications</li></ul><p>delivering reliable and consistent results in areas that require <strong>high mixing performance</strong>.</p> </div>$h$, $h$Drum Mixer | HD Marine$h$, $h$Industrial mixer motors and equipment are critical machines used for homogeneously mixing, dissolving or stabilizing liquids, gels, paints, chemicals and…$h$, 'auto') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
